The second major console from Nintendo (Super Famicom in Japan, Super Nintendo in Europe and the USA), is the successor of the Famicom or Nintendo Entertainment System. It uses roughly the same hardware architecture as its predecessor, yet slightly improved.{{Device page
|Manufacturer=Nintendo|Device release date=21. November 1990|Device type=Game Console|Has code name=SHVC}}

